  "3430|0e16a4d2": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Rogue",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Mangletooth",
   "npc": "3430",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "You! $R! Come here. <snort>\n\nTime is short, and my end <snort> is near. Mangletooth shall win; you will see. <snort>\n\nMy capture can still aid <snort> my people. The Razormane tribe is more powerful than the Bristlebacks!\n\nThe Horde looks to find out who leads the raids on their people. You <snort> shall aid Mangletooth in return for the information only I know. Mangletooth can help you! <snort> But you must help Mangletooth.",
   "time": 1791335930,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3430|71e13f0e": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Rogue",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Mangletooth",
   "npc": "3430",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "My hatred is strong <snort>, but the time is right to tell you a tale, $r.\n\nLong ago a battle took place between gods. Agamaggan, our great boar god, fell to the earth after being defeated in the War of the Ancients, his blood raining down and his bones torn asunder. <snort>\n\nGreat thorns reached up out of the earth where his blood touched the ground, and his skull adorns one of the caverns to the south.",
   "time": 1791335965,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3442|c0ad1190": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Rogue",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Sputtervalve",
   "npc": "3442",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Lots to do, lots to do! The Union's given us deadlines and they're not the sort you want to miss!",
   "time": 1791334029,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3446|36457281": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Rogue",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Mebok Mizzyrix",
   "npc": "3446",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Yes yes yes!  You're just the $r I'm looking for!\n\nSit!  We have much to discuss!!",
   "time": 1791334050,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3448|dcea3712": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Rogue",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Tonga Runetotem",
   "npc": "3448",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The times we live in are as fickle as the shifting winds, $c.  It is important to remember what is true and lasting in this world, and to preserve that.  Everything else is a waste.",
   "time": 1791335759,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
